### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
###  Crm REST API — Generated
###
###  Start the server:
###    dotnet run --project path/to/project --urls "http://localhost:5201"
###
###  Then click "Send Request" above any request below.
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### ──────────── Sites ────────────

### List all sites
GET http://localhost:5201/api/sites

### Get site by id
GET http://localhost:5201/api/sites/1

### Create a new site
POST http://localhost:5201/api/sites
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "City": "sample",
    "Region": "sample"
}

### ──────────── Products ────────────

### List all products
GET http://localhost:5201/api/products

### Get product by Sku
GET http://localhost:5201/api/products/example-value

### Create a new product
POST http://localhost:5201/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "ListPrice": 0,
    "Name": "sample",
    "Sku": "example-sku"
}

